{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["MIRU: Paths to My Future","\"未ル(Miru): Paths To My Future\", an anthology anime series by five animation studios.\n\n\n\nA Story of Encounters between Humanity and a Robot.\n\n\n\nBorn in a distant future, MIRU, a weaponless robot, travels across time to support people from different eras.\nMIRU meets individuals from different times and places, people who, despite their struggles, live their lives with determination.\n\n\n\nThrough their encounters with MIRU, people take small yet meaningful steps forward. These steps, like the \"Butterfly Effect,\" create waves of change, moving toward a brighter future.\n\n\n\n\"The future is in our hands.\"\n\n\n\nA story that reminds us of the power in every small beginning.\n\n\n\n(Source: It's Anime powered by REMOW)\n\n\nContains:\n\n1) Episode 079:「スターダストメモリー」 \"Stardust Memory\"\n\n2) Episode 101: 「The King of the Forest」\n\n3) Episode 217: 「この世の波風さわぎ」\"Londonderry Air\"\n\n4) Episode 630: 「Re: MIRU」\n\n5) Episode 926: 「待ってて、今行く」 \"Wait, I'll Be There\""],"ja":["未ル わたしのみらい",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[],"id":"mal-55727","ids":{"shikimori":55727,"mal":55727,"anilist":166373,"kodik":"serial-67315"},"kodikIds":["serial-66161","serial-67315"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-66161":"2025-05-01T15:58:40Z","serial-67315":"2025-05-13T07:01:18Z"},"title":"Миру: Моё будущее","originalTitle":"Miru: Watashi no Mirai","alt":"Miru: Paths to My Future MIRU: Paths to My Future 未ル わたしのみらい","description":"В далёком будущем люди создают робота по имени МИРУ, способного путешествовать во времени, посещая разные эпохи, места и даже параллельные миры. В отличие от других роботов, МИРУ не оснащён оружием. Вместо этого он помогает людям преодолевать серьёзные препятствия мирным путём, вдохновляя на новые начинания без насилия. МИРУ постоянно совершенствуется, общаясь с людьми, учась и развиваясь, чтобы помогать тем, кто борется за выживание. Он выслушивает их проблемы и оказывает поддержку. Помогая другим, МИРУ запускает «эффект бабочки» — цепочку кардинальных перемен, ведущих общество к светлому будущему. Зачем был создан МИРУ? В чём его предназначение? Сможет ли он спасти Землю и человечество от антиутопического будущего?","year":2025,"type":"TV","genres":["Фантастика"],"rating":5.31,"popularity":3047,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/55727/df17600c0fecd42dd200c539dcca0cd6.jpeg","width":685,"height":975},"backdrop":{"url":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/166373-iaT2Eog6fORQ.jpg","width":1900,"height":400}},"releasedEpisodes":[1,2,3,4,5],"episodes":[{"number":1,"ordinal":1,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-910","dubId":"910","label":"AniStar","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"serial-66161","translationId":"910","url":"https://kodikplayer.com/seria/1440613/217630b202be4adb9054e824fc52252b/720p","season":1,"ordinal":1}},{"id":"kodik-825","dubId":"825","label":"AniMaunt","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"serial-67315","translationId":"825","url":"https://kodikplayer.com/seria/1457408/b604d05fd09061b042a75dc4d7457023/720p","season":1,"ordinal":1}}]},{"number":2,"ordinal":2,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-910","dubId":"910","label":"AniStar","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"serial-66161","translationId":"910","url":"https://kodikplayer.com/seria/1443419/5be56170b82e11363aebd98a428df086/720p","season":1,"ordinal":2}},{"id":"kodik-825","dubId":"825","label":"AniMaunt","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"s